  metal:name=>`This category describes how ${name} reacts to global risk sentiment, real rates, and crisis dynamics – the most important short-term drivers alongside the structural factors.`,
  energy:name=>`This category describes how ${name} reacts to global risk sentiment and economic expectations – the second key price driver alongside supply/demand.`,
  index:name=>`This category describes how ${name} reacts to the global liquidity and risk environment – the dominant short-term driver for equity indices alongside individual fundamentals.`,
